---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import { site, analytics } from '../config/site';
---

<ContentLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${site.name}`}
  description="Privacy policy for decodingvba.com."
>
  <p><em>Last updated: August 20, 2026</em></p>

  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>
    Decoding VBA ("we", "us") operates decodingvba.com. This policy explains what
    information we collect and how we use it.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We use <a href="https://plausible.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Plausible Analytics</a>,
    a privacy-friendly analytics service, to understand aggregate traffic on this site.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Provider:</strong> Plausible Insights OÜ (
      <a href={analytics.sitePolicyUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">privacy policy</a>)
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Data collected:</strong> Page URL, referrer, browser/device type, and general
      location (country/region). Plausible does not use cookies and does not track you across
      other websites.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Legal basis:</strong> Legitimate interest in understanding how our free content is
      used so we can improve it.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Opt-out:</strong> You can block the Plausible script with a browser ad blocker or
      enable Do Not Track — Plausible respects DNT signals.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    See Plausible's <a href={analytics.policyUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">data policy</a>
    for full details on what they process.
  </p>

  <h2>Other information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Purchases:</strong> If you buy a course, payment and delivery are handled by
      our checkout provider (Lemon Squeezy or Gumroad). Their privacy policy applies to
      transaction data — we do not receive your full payment card details.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Email:</strong> If you contact us at {site.email}, we use your email only to
      respond to your message.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Search:</strong> On-site search uses Pagefind, which runs in your browser against
      a static index bundled with the site. Search queries are not sent to our servers.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This site does not set analytics cookies. Third-party checkout pages may set cookies when
    you visit them or complete a purchase.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Privacy questions: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
  </p>
</ContentLayout>
